  "details": "Feature Request:\n\n- The ability to create savable presets with custom safety settings for use in different situations\n\n- The ability to assign those presets to certain types of worlds (Public/Friends+/Invite/etc)\n\nReasoning:\n\nI, and many others, use custom safety settings exclusively due to it being easily tailored to our specific needs, however, having to change each rank's settings for different instances can be a real inconvenience. I often find myself in public instances wanting to mute ranks below user, and hide the avatars of those same individuals in an effort to protect myself from trolls/crashers/etc. However, In certain instances, IE Group instances that are moderated, I feel safer enabling lower ranks. Therefore I feel as though it would be beneficial to implement custom presets for the safety system, as well as having the ability to set them to automatically apply upon entering a specific instance type.",
